<a name="TOPS">
<h2>Tops in Science Fiction</h2>
<i>Tops in Science Fiction</i> was a reprint digest for <i>Planet Stories</i>. There
were only 2 issues in the US, while the British edition published 3 issues (the first
2 British issues containing stories from the 1st US issue, and the 3rd containing
stories from the 2nd US issue).
