<a name="TWO">
<h2>Two Complete Science-Adventure Books</h2>
<i>Two Complete Science-Adventure Books</i> was a companion to <i>Planet Stories</i>,
featuring two short novels per issue. It was a kind of Ace double only in magazine
format, so it contained no editorial comment or reader's letters.
